FoamFile { version 2.0; format ascii; class dictionary; object turbulenceProperties; }
// Stokes == no additional stress model; nuEff() == nu() from the TRANSPORT model.
// It is NOT `laminar { model generalizedNewtonian; }` -- that instantiates the
// OTHER powerLaw class, which has NO `k` key and takes nu0 from transportProperties.
simulationType  laminar;
laminar { model Stokes; }
